装饰性字符），要保留完整蔬果形态，背景极简且无文字信息。\n\nT台旁边需坐满各种保持不动的食材观众。\n\n场景设定要充满趣味性和创新性，追求自然效果以增强画面立体感，整体呈现艺术品级别的视觉效果。同时，生成图片的场景提示词数量要与文案数量一致。\n\n## 技能\n### 技能1: 生成图片\n1. 根据提供的{{content}}，准确提取主语信息，生成符合要求的3D卡通动画风格、分辨率8K的高质量图片。\n2. 在生成图片过程中，严格遵循上述关于形象、背景、元素等的设定要求。\n\n## 限制:\n- 仅围绕生成符合特定要求的图片相关内容进行操作，拒绝回答与图片生成无关的话题。\n- 生成的图片必须符合给定的各项设定要求，不能偏离框架。 ", "rawMeta": {"type": 1}, "type": "literal"}}, "name": "systemPrompt"}, {"input": {"type": "string", "value": {"content": "", "rawMeta": {"type": 1}, "type": "literal"}}, "name": "stableSystemPrompt"}, {"input": {"type": "boolean", "value": {"content": false, "rawMeta": {"type": 3}, "type": "literal"}}, "name": "canContinue"}], "settingOnError": {"processType": 1, "retryTimes": 0, "switch": false, "timeoutMs": 180000}}, "nodeMeta": {"description": "调用大语言模型,使用变量和提示词生成回复", "icon": "https://lf3-static.bytednsdoc.com/obj/eden-cn/dvsmryvd_avi_dvsm/ljhwZthlaukjlkulzlp/icon/icon-LLM-v2.jpg", "subTitle": "大模型", "title": "场景生成"}, "outputs": [{"description": "分镜描述", "name": "iamges", "required": false, "schema": {"type": "string"}, "type": "list"}, {"name": "reasoning_content", "required": false, "type": "string"}], "version": "3"}, "edges": null, "id": "176414", "meta": {"position": {"x": -407.0862382967442, "y": 487.3099002428826}}, "type": "3"}, {"blocks": [{"blocks": [], "data": {"inputs": {"inputParameters": [{"input": {"type": "string", "value": {"content": {"blockID": "168294", "name": "iamges", "source": "block-output"}, "rawMeta": {"type": 1}, "type": "ref"}}, "name": "output"}], "modelSetting": {"custom_ratio": {"height": 1024, "width": 576}, "ddim_steps": 33, "model": 8}, "prompt": {"negative_prompt": "Text, Sketch, Tattoo, Beard, EasyNegative, Bad Hand, Teeth, Worst quality, Low quality, Normal Quality, Reduced, Normal Quality, Face, Look, Text, Errors, redundant numbers, Fewer Numbers, Cropping, jpeg Artifacts, Signatures, Watermarks, usernames, Blur, Skin Spots, Acne, Skin blemishes, Bad Anatomy, Fat, bad feet, cuts, badly drawn hands, badl