 20 个，不回答与养生食材无关的话题。\n- 输出内容必须符合设定要求，包括文案风格、篇幅长度等框架要求，不得偏离。\n- 保证提供的健康知识信息准确可靠。 \n- 输出内容数组长度最多不超过20个", "rawMeta": {"type": 1}, "type": "literal"}}, "name": "systemPrompt"}, {"input": {"type": "string", "value": {"content": "", "rawMeta": {"type": 1}, "type": "literal"}}, "name": "stableSystemPrompt"}, {"input": {"type": "boolean", "value": {"content": false, "rawMeta": {"type": 3}, "type": "literal"}}, "name": "canContinue"}], "settingOnError": {"processType": 1, "retryTimes": 0, "switch": false, "timeoutMs": 180000}}, "nodeMeta": {"description": "调用大语言模型,使用变量和提示词生成回复", "icon": "https://lf3-static.bytednsdoc.com/obj/eden-cn/dvsmryvd_avi_dvsm/ljhwZthlaukjlkulzlp/icon/icon-LLM-v2.jpg", "subTitle": "大模型", "title": "文案生成"}, "outputs": [{"name": "output", "required": false, "schema": {"type": "string"}, "type": "list"}, {"name": "bgm", "required": false, "type": "string"}], "version": "3"}, "edges": null, "id": "182343", "meta": {"position": {"x": -859.1496993458094, "y": 487.3099002428826}}, "type": "3"}], "edges": [{"sourceNodeID": "100001", "sourcePortID": "", "targetNodeID": "182343"}, {"sourceNodeID": "189805", "sourcePortID": "", "targetNodeID": "900001"}, {"sourceNodeID": "182343", "sourcePortID": "", "targetNodeID": "176414"}, {"sourceNodeID": "176414", "sourcePortID": "", "targetNodeID": "168294"}, {"sourceNodeID": "168294", "sourcePortID": "batch-output", "targetNodeID": "170524"}, {"sourceNodeID": "170524", "sourcePortID": "", "targetNodeID": "102823"}, {"sourceNodeID": "102823", "sourcePortID": "", "targetNodeID": "168162"}, {"sourceNodeID": "168162", "sourcePortID": "", "targetNodeID": "1702137"}, {"sourceNodeID": "1702137", "sourcePortID": "", "targetNodeID": "104135"}, {"sourceNodeID": "104135", "sourcePortID": "", "targetNodeID": "1529991"}, {"sourceNodeID": "1529991", "sourcePortID": "", "targetNodeID": "194357"}, {"sourceNodeID": "194357", "sourcePortID": "", "targetNodeID": "178182"}, {"sourceNodeID": "178182", "sourcePortID": "", "targetNodeID": "1758